WEBVTT

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:15.830
Brother...

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.140
I can't have you die again.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.400
Where are they?

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.010
Where did they go?

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.030
Could it be?

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.910
Kagakagari...

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.970
...so it was you!

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.500
<i>Asura Cryin' 2</i>

00:02:13.970 --> 00:02:17.940
"The Cost of Calling the Sacrifice's Name"

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:17.180
Tomo.

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:18.650
Tomo!

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:20.850
Come on, Tomo!

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:26.020
You're awake!

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:27.630
Misao?

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.270
Huh?

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:51.490
Hey, boy.

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:56.220
Kagakagari and...

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:57.540
...curry?

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.890
Kagakagari saved me?

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:01.710
Yes.

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:03.180
It seems that way.

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:04.710
I didn't save anyone.

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:07.410
I just took you in.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.290
Then that was...

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:15.020
Where is Shuri-san?

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:17.450
I see.

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:20.480
Well, I'm sure she can take care of herself.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.120
Eat while it's hot.

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:31.230
Ania was taken by a GD named Kyomu Satomi.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:32.140
What?

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:33.400
Ania was here?

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:38.190
He's holding Ania hostage to get to you two.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:40.630
So?

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.070
What are you trying to say?

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:45.740
Are you asking us to save her?

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.650
I hate to break it to you, but we can't do that.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.590
Are you fine with that, Christina-san?

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.020
I'm worried about Ania...

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:02.520
...but I can't put Takaya in harm's way because of her.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:03.950
You can't be serious!

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:06.250
Our sole objective...

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:10.980
...is freeing Kotori from the Asura Machina.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:15.380
Takaya has incredible power...

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:18.500
...and he's paid a terrible price for it.

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:23.020
He can't squander his power.

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:27.690
Takaya and I don't have any time to spare.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.300
She's vanishing.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:41.500
Boy, I'm sure you know...

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:44.170
...the cost we're referring to.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:46.840
Tomo?

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.840
Tomo, what does he mean by "cost?"

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.860
Is it the reason you didn't try to use Kurogane earlier?

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:56.420
Answer me, Tomo!

00:04:57.090 --> 00:04:58.420
I don't want to.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.180
Why not, Tomo?

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.790
I don't want to tell you!

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:05.000
Misao, I don't want...

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:18.920
Kotori?

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:21.450
It's alright.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:27.140
You need to communicate what's important.

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:34.640
Is the cost...

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:38.780
...whittling away my soul to use the Asura Machina?

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:40.300
Misao...

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.010
You knew?

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:44.710
I knew from the start.

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:46.770
After all, it's happening to me.

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:51.260
I don't like it either, Tomo.

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:54.080
I don't like hurting others for my sake...

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:57.020
...or when you hurt others.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.020
I don't want to see that happen.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.360
Sheesh.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:10.940
Looking at you two reminds me of a past I'd rather forget.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:11.590
Huh?

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:16.140
Burial dolls are a bunch of meddlesome softies.

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:17.550
It's irritating.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.780
What happened between the two of you?

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.070
We made a promise to each other.

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:30.540
A promise?

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:35.680
Kotori chose to become a burial doll to save me.

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:37.470
She sacrificed herself?

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:40.820
It wasn't a sacrifice.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:42.810
She believed...

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:48.540
...it wouldn't be long before we figured out how to free her.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:52.010
Does that mean we can find that method in these ruins?

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:55.300
Takaya!

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:58.300
Don't look at me like that.

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:02.820
Fine, fine.

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:04.170
Let's go, boy.

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:04.730
Huh?

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:07.340
I have no intention to help you...

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:11.400
...but if the dogs of the Student Union are after me...

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:13.480
...we'll have to fight.

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:14.660
Come with me.

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:18.120
I'll tell you what you want to know.

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:22.320
Do you hate Takaya?

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:23.620
Huh?

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:24.530
You like him?

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:26.970
I wouldn't say that.

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:28.700
I see.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:32.520
I don't know what it means to like and dislike any more.

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:34.510
Or to love and hate.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.330
I just don't want Takaya to suffer.

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:41.360
If I'm gone, Takaya will be sad.

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:43.560
That's why I stay by his side.

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.900
Stop!

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:53.930
Let me go!

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:55.640
I said, let me go!

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.780
You jerk!

00:07:58.190 --> 00:07:59.250
Why you little brat!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.480
Ow!

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.540
Let me go!

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:08.500
What'd you do that for?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.350
Your luck is disgusting.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:14.260
These ruins are all that's left of a gravitational tuning facility.

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:17.460
These were Asura Machina testing grounds...

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:19.580
...so it should be around here somewhere.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.370
The technology to free Kotori from the Asura Machina...

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:24.310
...and bring her back to life.

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:29.710
I'll do anything to get my hands on it.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:32.470
The contents of this capsule...

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:34.970
It's what Takaya has been searching for.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:36.760
Ingrid.

00:08:43.110 --> 00:08:45.660
I guess it has to be the powers of an Asura Cryin'.

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:49.420
I just need a little more from you, Kotori.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.390
Rise, Rhodonite!

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:08.460
Do it!

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.610
A trunk?

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:34.810
Above you!

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.020
Wow.

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:52.310
Christina-san!

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:59.010
No...

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:00.770
That's terrible.

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:01.740
Why is this happening?

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:05.500
Why do you push yourself so hard to help Kagakagari?

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.850
You're so kind.

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:11.550
I think I can see why Ania trusts you.

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:14.610
That's why I want you to know...

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:17.810
...the fate of one who makes a deal with a demon.

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:19.310
What fate?

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:24.390
This fire wielding girl was probably trying to hide it from you...

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:32.380
...but we demons disappear because the world is trying to eliminate us.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.730
It is the reason we seek contractors.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:42.870
Just as the Asura Machina consumes the burial doll's soul to fuel its magic...

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:48.710
...every time a demon uses magic, it consumes some of its contractors love.

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:50.970
Consumes their love?

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:53.650
Then Kagakagari is...

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:56.820
I'm the one who stole love from Kagakagari.

00:10:57.530 --> 00:10:59.900
I didn't want to lose Takaya...

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:02.610
...so I used my powers...

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:05.340
...and gradually made him forget what it means to love.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:09.660
You can't repeat my mistake.

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:15.210
And if possible, tell my sister...

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.290
...I may have been foolish...

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:20.090
...but I was happy.

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:22.730
You can't do this!

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:26.690
You need to tell Nia-chan yourself!

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:30.190
Come on, Tomo! Let's go save Nia-chan!

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:32.510
Call Kurogane!

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:34.510
Fight with your Asura Machina!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.510
I...

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.000
I'll be fine!

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.090
Come on, Tomo!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:44.700
I forgive your decision...

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:48.840
...so please, don't blame Takaya.

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:51.400
I...

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:52.220
Please.

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:16.130
It's just as I thought.

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:20.450
An Asura Cryin' is vulnerable after using his magic.

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:22.540
Kyomu Satomi!

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:26.240
I was just hoping to kill Kagakagari...

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:28.850
...but it looks like you've got something good there.

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:33.290
I'm sure everyone would be jealous if I brought that back.

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:35.610
Good work.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.510
Now leave the rest to me.

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:45.480
It'd be great if you would just lie down and die.

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:55.140
This is the end, Takaya Kagakagari!

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.050
We'll see about that, kid!

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.850
Look, Kagakagari!

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:19.290
Nia!

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:20.170
Nia-chan!

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:25.460
Fire!

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:35.120
Rhodonite!

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:51.370
Christy!

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:01.620
Don't do it, Christy!

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:10.990
Christina!

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.190
So the demon vanished.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.710
What a pity.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:44.890
But don't worry.

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:46.830
I'll put her out of your misery.

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:55.550
Do it, Takatsuki!

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:58.460
Fire!

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:00.160
Hurry up and shoot them!

00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:01.160
Damn it!

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:02.780
The luck eater's power!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:15.260
Christina!

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:17.170
Hang in there, Christina!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:22.750
Christina.

00:15:23.430 --> 00:15:24.340
Christina.

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:27.510
Why?

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:30.070
Tomoharu, save her.

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:32.070
Hurry! Please!

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:33.860
Please!

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.180
Save her!

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:49.420
Christy...

00:15:57.770 --> 00:15:58.440
No...

00:15:59.000 --> 00:15:59.760
No...

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:01.000
Christina.

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:17.100
What a noisy brat.

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:20.090
We've wasted enough time.

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:21.650
Let's finish this.

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:25.090
Kotori!

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:31.460
Thank you for loving us.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:34.750
Don't do it, Kotori!

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:35.750
Our promise...!

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:38.950
Bismuth!

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:51.640
Die.

00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:58.960
Surely you don't intend to get in my way.

00:16:59.190 --> 00:17:00.280
I made up my mind.

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:04.150
I'll take on the pain!

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:05.770
Natsume-kun...

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:08.740
Don't worry.

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:10.910
You have me, Tomo.

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:19.080
Come, Kurogane!

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:25.330
Get out of the way!

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:35.560
What's that?

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.640
I'm the winner! It's a pushover!

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:42.990
Bismuth's spinning lance dispels even the most powerful magic.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:48.630
But if it doesn't spin, you're powerless.

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:51.680
Impossible!

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:56.650
What is this strength?

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:58.970
That's impossible!

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:01.820
From the abyss deeper than darkness...

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:02.380
This is...!

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:04.960
It is the shadow cast by science.

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:19.150
This is the end, Kyomu Satomi.

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:20.530
Just give up.

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:21.760
The end?

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:23.850
I haven't lost yet.

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:28.310
There's no way I'd lose to a little brat like you!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:32.020
If you continue to fight, your burial doll will die.

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:37.360
What do I care if that sacrifice dies?

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.590
"What do I care?"

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.830
That's right. It doesn't matter who dies...

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:45.120
...as long as I survive.

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:46.380
Die, die!

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:48.020
What are you doing, Bismuth?

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.170
Kill them all!

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:51.260
That's it, kill them!

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:52.870
Kill them all!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.400
Why you...

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:25.830
How do you do, Tomoharu Natsume-sama?

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:48.010
Shouldn't we go after her?

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:51.000
We don't need it any more.

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:51.710
What?

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:03.250
Christy and Kotori...

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:04.690
...are gone.

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:27.840
There you are.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:30.430
Shuri-san!

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:31.660
You're alright.

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:33.450
More or less.

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:35.980
Oh, my. The president's filthy.

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:42.470
Take this.

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:45.350
All of the data from Christy's research is on there.

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:48.700
Are you sure?

00:20:49.610 --> 00:20:50.610
I told you.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:53.400
I don't need anything any more.

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:55.220
Not the data, not the ruins...

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:57.600
...not the future.

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:06.620
Nia, uh...

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:09.230
I'll analyze the data.

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:10.110
Huh?

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:14.460
I won't waste anything my sister left behind.

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:16.600
Not a single thing.

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:19.950
Nia-chan...

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:21.390
What?

00:21:22.270 --> 00:21:26.880
Your sister said she was happy.

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:33.700
Tomo.

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:36.140
Nia.

00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:39.160
Oh, um...

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:40.430
It'll be okay.

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:42.600
We're here for you.

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:46.950
Thank you.

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:22.030
Undecided.

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:23.530
Lost.

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:25.850
Your warmth leads the way.

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:27.670
If only I could retie...

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:28.380
...tightly...

00:23:28.380 --> 00:23:29.110
...tightly...

00:23:29.230 --> 00:23:31.350
...the connection coming undone.

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:34.390
"The Sad Connection between Love and Magic"
